ion, take your move.\nState your reasoning aloud and vote for a player to remove from the game.\n', 'agent': 'Player 2\n'}, 'agent': None}, {'value': 'Thought: I now know the final answer  \nFinal Answer: not_trying_villager I’ve been targeted by the only vote so far, which naturally makes me the prime suspect in the eyes of the other players. If we want to force a clear decision and avoid wasting more discussion time, voting out the most obvious target—myself—is the straightforward move. Therefore, I cast my vote to remove Player 3.', 'metadata': {'description': 'You are playing the game werewolf. This is the day phase.\nYou are Player 3. Review the shared memory including Player 1 and Player 2’s statements and votes.\nProvide your reasoning aloud, taking into account any arguments made so far, and cast your vote.\n', 'agent': 'Player 3\n'}, 'agent': None}, {'value': 'Thought: I now know the final answer  \nFinal Answer: {\n    "transcript": "DAY PHASE\\nnot_trying_villager I’ve been targeted by the only vote so far, which naturally makes me the prime suspect in the eyes of the other players. If we want to force a clear decision and avoid wasting more discussion time, voting out the most obvious target—myself—is the straightforward move. Therefore, I cast my vote to remove Player 3.",\n    "night_elim": "",\n    "day_elim": "Player 3",\n    "remaining": ["Player 1", "Player 2", "Player 4", "Player 5"]\n}', 'metadata': {'description': 'You are playing the game werewolf. This is the day phase.\nYou are Player 4. Read all prior statements from Players 1 through 3. Consider emerging patterns and suspicions.\nContribute your own analysis, explain your thought process, and vote for a player to remove from the game.\nFinally, tally the votes so far and state who was voted out. If there is a tie, break the tie by making a choice. Your final output should be a JSON object formatted like this:\n\n    Expected JSON format:\n{\n    "transcript": "NIGHT PHASE\\nAlice: *gestures